Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1. Add `IsValidSlotName` to validate DSU slot names. We restrict characters
   to `[a-zA-Z0-9_-.]` and reject reserved names: "booted", "active",
   "lp_names", "install_status", "one_shot_boot", "avb", "avb_enforce".
   This prevents directory creation at reserved file paths (like "booted")
   which can spoof GSI state.
2. In `IsGsiRunning()`, check that `kGsiBootedIndicatorFile` is a regular
   file (S_ISREG) to prevent directory pre-creation from spoofing the state.

Bug: 514746269
Test: libgsi_test, DsuGsiToolTest
